{"articleNo":"141847","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=141847&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"Japan Kanazawa University MEXT Scholarship for research student","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.12.10","hit":"2675","attachments":[{"name":"MEXT Scholarship 2016.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=141847&attachNo=75482"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Please be noted&nbsp;the call for </font></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">‘‘</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">2016 JAPANESE GOVERNMENT (MONBUKAGAKUSHO) SCHOLARSHIP FOR RESEARCH STUDENT</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">’’</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">. <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></font></span></font></font></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">This scholarship program is mainly for people who seeks a Master</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">’</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">s or Doctoral degree at Kanazawa University. For details, please kindly check the attached file, </font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">‘‘</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">MEXT Scholarship 2016</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">’’</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">. <o:p></o:p></font></span></font></font></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Applications must reach the prospective graduate school at Kanazawa University by JANUARY 15, 2016. <o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Before submit the application, the applicants must find the supervisor here in Kanazawa University. <o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Following page will help you to find the supervisor in Kanazawa University;<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span></font></font></font><a href=\"http://ridb.kanazawa-u.ac.jp/public/index_en.php\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">http://ridb.kanazawa-u.ac.jp/public/index_en.php</font></u></a><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">The graduate school will inform the applicant and your institution of the result of the scholarship selection in May.<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Please do not hesitate to contact Ms. KAIDA</span>　</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\">Mie at the Global Affairs Support Office (E-mail: </font><a href=\"mailto:ryukou@adm.kanazawa-u.ac.jp\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\">ryukou@adm.kanazawa-u.ac.jp</font></u></a><font color=\"#000000\">)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span>for further questions or concerns regarding the application.<o:p></o:p></font></span></font></font></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
